.TH WOLFETCH 1 "August 2026" "wolfetch 0.5.0-pre.5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wolfetch \- tiny, fast system fetch for Linux and BSD
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wolfetch
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
wolfetch prints a concise system summary beside a minimal wolf. It does not
require systemd or a background service.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-p, \-\-plain
Disable ANSI colors.
.TP
.B \-j, \-\-json
Print machine-readable JSON.
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-no-logo
Disable the wolf artwork.
.TP
.B \-f, \-\-fast
Skip CPU, GPU, CPU usage and process memory collection.
.TP
.BI \-\-theme\ NAME
Select a built-in theme.
.TP
.BI \-\-config\ PATH
Load a specific key=value configuration file.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/wolfetch/config
.br
.I ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME}/wolfetch/config
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wolfetch (5)
